    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEw">II Ew</ref> 1.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hit swa dó, bete swa hit beforan awriten is: æt forman cyrre XXX scll. ⁊ æt oðran cyrre ealswa ⁊ æt þriddan mid CXX scll. ðam cyninge.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If anyone does so, he shall pay such compensation as has already been prescribed—on the first occasion 30 shillings, on the second the same amount, and on the third 120 shillings to the king.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hit swa do, bete swa hit beoforan awriten is: æt forman cyrre XXX scyl' ⁊ æt oðran cyrre ealswa ⁊ æt ðriddan mid CXX scyl' ðam cynge.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
